    "identifier": "1080-psi-air-cannon",
    "description": "<p>You use the air itself to slash an enemy at a distance. You swing your blade and launch a compressed cross slash of air spiraling forward. Make a ranged taijutsu attack, targeting a creature within range. On a hit, you deal your [Weapons damage] + 2d6.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw, gaining a rank of Bleed on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: Affected creature makes their concentration check at disadvantage and must make a Constitution saving throw, becoming Bruised on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank this jutsu is cast above C-Rank, increase the cost by 3 and damage by 1d6.</p>",
